; The VIEW form of index-map application: the output value is the
; parent's own storage reinterpreted through the composed offset
; function, so no bytes move. Matched only where the Layout field IS
; the composed layout (parent offset precomposed with the index map);
; materializing into any other layout is the op above.
(constructor LayoutTensorOpIndexMapApplyViewGeneric (LayoutTensor IndexMap Shape Layout) LayoutTensorOp)
